        "summary": "Field-induced SMM-like AC response under 1000 Oe but no χM'' peak down to 2 K and no SMT sigmoidal M(H) curve. Weak intramolecular ferromagnetic coupling inferred from a low-T χMT upturn. Solid-state CD of Λ-1 and Δ-1 is nearly mirror-symmetrical (Cotton effect ~320 nm).",
